{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/app.bsky.feed.post/3lj6e3awfb223","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i","uri":"at://did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/app.bsky.feed.post/3lj6e3awfb223","cid":"bafyreih5qrtjtp2xim3wa7moqxhpunbanygmx7nebwl2rjkatrestv2ucu","auteur_did":"did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/sbg-senat.bsky.social/post/3lj6e3awfb223","date":"2025-02-27T16:52:03.894Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-02-27T16:52:10.463Z","text":"🇪🇹 Fin du déplacement en Éthiopie. J’ai visité le Palais national, bientôt ouvert après une rénovation de 25 M€ financée par l’AFD, un symbole d’unité. À l’Union africaine, j’ai échangé sur la paix, la sécurité et les droits des femmes. Merci pour ces rencontres enrichissantes !","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"images":[{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreiahxmta5koba7calaakww4fqj7wljtgoyqgfsu4hovfc3ekiay7om","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreiahxmta5koba7calaakww4fqj7wljtgoyqgfsu4hovfc3ekiay7om","alt":"","ar":{"height":2000,"width":1500}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreiapddy5c5qo6aiicldshonjpsleoj7mhkckitbhljv2xxyrg4ov6q","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreiapddy5c5qo6aiicldshonjpsleoj7mhkckitbhljv2xxyrg4ov6q","alt":"","ar":{"height":2000,"width":1500}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreic3ggdfx3hd6i64233zuz6bavfxjou4bjpt6nuyxitg65zfkyakqe","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreic3ggdfx3hd6i64233zuz6bavfxjou4bjpt6nuyxitg65zfkyakqe","alt":"","ar":{"height":1073,"width":2000}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreifmqhybszq26varvn3mmi4kus62