{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/app.bsky.feed.post/3lj3iad7jqc2p","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i","uri":"at://did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/app.bsky.feed.post/3lj3iad7jqc2p","cid":"bafyreigv7wsbbcijp4cm3bzt6cjfx5ecwwmbiqk242okedm4uy5huuffsa","auteur_did":"did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/sbg-senat.bsky.social/post/3lj3iad7jqc2p","date":"2025-02-26T13:28:29.803Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-02-26T13:28:37.057Z","text":"🇪🇹 Entreprendre en Éthiopie n'est pas aisé : protectionnisme, contrôles fiscaux, règles changeantes... Pourtant, des Français s'y lancent, de la poterie traditionnelle à l’herboristerie. Ce parcours illustre une persévérance à toute épreuve face aux défis locaux.","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"images":[{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreigmgtp2wrwhwnlckks6fmojur6tif2n5tzjxz3d5rhsfg4jxla5kq","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreigmgtp2wrwhwnlckks6fmojur6tif2n5tzjxz3d5rhsfg4jxla5kq","alt":"","ar":{"height":2000,"width":1500}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreid3jyp5zpib2bmk7rposps7taacm6e7fzomxpqwn2qqamo5hsdgpq","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreid3jyp5zpib2bmk7rposps7taacm6e7fzomxpqwn2qqamo5hsdgpq","alt":"","ar":{"height":1500,"width":2000}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreidn4gb2mqw6t54hgbsb2dlr7dfgseadaucfoyga2pd6lehhg7o7my","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreidn4gb2mqw6t54hgbsb2dlr7dfgseadaucfoyga2pd6lehhg7o7my","alt":"","ar":{"height":1500,"width":2000}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreifdx2jhnmacp4vjaxjx2g3trqf3ml5babdq3vcbaje5