{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/app.bsky.feed.post/3lizb2fqybk2q","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i","uri":"at://did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/app.bsky.feed.post/3lizb2fqybk2q","cid":"bafyreieaqb6bhzu662jcxswadzupw4chir7vrnxulchqiykb64wfmng4w4","auteur_did":"did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/sbg-senat.bsky.social/post/3lizb2fqybk2q","date":"2025-02-25T16:14:35.480Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-02-25T16:14:41.863Z","text":"🇪🇹 À Addis-Abeba, j’ai découvert une communauté française engagée et des lieux emblématiques comme le lycée Guebre-Mariam. Cette institution, au cœur des liens franco-éthiopiens, continue de former des générations d’élèves. Un grand bravo aux équipes pour leur travail et leur dévouement !","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"images":[{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreicrkysktudls4pqfjxywin3ibjon7nfmsi6c4zmv7i5vw7wignpv4","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreicrkysktudls4pqfjxywin3ibjon7nfmsi6c4zmv7i5vw7wignpv4","alt":"","ar":{"height":1279,"width":2000}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreibckef55fs3tvlybsmle6a5vohbfh7bzoib5qg566stxvuq4xz25e","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreibckef55fs3tvlybsmle6a5vohbfh7bzoib5qg566stxvuq4xz25e","alt":"","ar":{"height":1172,"width":1848}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreia5gr67ssbzmhz4dzalfbqhap3rbuviw5pekugrrdujpkz6nnhaea","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreia5gr67ssbzmhz4dzalfbqhap3rbuviw5pekugrrdujpkz6nnhaea","alt":"","ar":{"height":1328,"width":1836}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreidktf4scw4gs37ohu