{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:ij2zfnls7gz6rwailozlrcwd/app.bsky.feed.post/3limkgj72w22e","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:ij2zfnls7gz6rwailozlrcwd","uri":"at://did:plc:ij2zfnls7gz6rwailozlrcwd/app.bsky.feed.post/3limkgj72w22e","cid":"bafyreickjg4zoun6vs4vt2kio7yqe5xbzmlbruuk5kpbxgwhfnunfxtori","auteur_did":"did:plc:ij2zfnls7gz6rwailozlrcwd","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/vincentcaure.bsky.social/post/3limkgj72w22e","date":"2025-02-20T14:57:48.844Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-02-20T14:57:51.256Z","text":"Ce matin, en commission d'enquête sur l'organisation des élections en France, j'ai défendu le vote en ligne 🗳","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"video":{"thumb":"https://video.bsky.app/watch/did%3Aplc%3Aij2zfnls7gz6rwailozlrcwd/bafkreib7fdnog23iw7kloaxowbn3gjnt45yfhfdyt5l427omkquq6r5vqi/thumbnail.jpg","alt":""}},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3limdblmu422j","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","uri":"at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3limdblmu422j","cid":"bafyreigr4lrlu3r7f5ct2cdx53pxebb6odmffg6ykh3ayy7r2frr6ht7we","auteur_did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/kbencheikh.bsky.social/post/3limdblmu422j","date":"2025-02-20T12:49:47.430Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-02-20T12:49:52.250Z","text":"✅ Notre proposition de loi contre les polluants éternels est définitivement adoptée après un vote conforme au Sénat et à l’Assemblée ! \n \nMerci à la mobilisation générale qui a permis de faire aboutir ce texte porté par mes collègues @mcgarin.bsky.social et @nicolas-thierry.bsky.social !","facets":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet","features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention","did":"did:plc:vktnzfvfaqag3adcukw76yij"}],"index":{"byteEnd":270,"byteStart":250}},{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet","features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention","did":"did:plc:qebpzhinbeqiurcca4mmqmfx"}],"index":{"byteEnd":302,"byteStart":274}}],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"images":[{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/bafkreib23ytxqws2dfnevrq3oeenuirg4kqvq3gv5qon7dywbygjaadoyu","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/bafkreib23ytxqws2dfnevrq3oeenuirg4kqvq3gv5qon7dywbygjaadoyu","alt":"","ar":{"height":1280,"width":1024}}]},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lilt4ixe4c2m","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","uri":"at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lilt4ixe4c2m","cid":"bafyreifw42lzfrjfn4ottptjnhm7vsdocua5wzclszc5dnfcgk732xpusa","auteur_did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/kbencheikh.bsky.social/post/3lilt4ixe4c2m","date":"2025-02-20T08:00:36.947Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-02-20T08:00:40.755Z","text":"📢  Ce jeudi 20 février, c’est notre #JourneeEcoS2025 ! \n\nLe @ecologisteetsocial.fr défendra 7 textes essentiels pour protéger notre avenir ✊\n\nUne journée cruciale pour faire avancer l’écologie, la justice sociale et fiscale !","facets":[{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag","tag":"JourneeEcoS2025"}],"index":{"byteEnd":59,"byteStart":43}},{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet","features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention","did":"did:plc:6fvg7hik6q7l4ainsozsorw2"}],"index":{"byteEnd":90,"byteStart":68}}],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"images":[{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/bafkreidx7mgpfxmbxjttrhcdyoiwqfooi2amqiaczql4rpx4ggxrf7wg5q","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/bafkreidx7mgpfxmbxjttrhcdyoiwqfooi2amqiaczql4rpx4ggxrf7wg5q","alt":"","ar":{"height":1280,"width":1024}}]},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/app.bsky.feed.post/3lik6iwxhhc2u","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i","uri":"at://did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/app.bsky.feed.post/3lik6iwxhhc2u","cid":"bafyreidomw47bi54va36dcytlbrpvbsce4srpedfznws275thm6a5vpex4","auteur_did":"did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/sbg-senat.bsky.social/post/3lik6iwxhhc2u","date":"2025-02-19T16:19:06.010Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-02-19T16:19:07.562Z","text":"Nous avons aussi auditionné Richard Ferrand, proposé par Emmanuel Macron pour présider le Conseil constitutionnel. Je l’ai interrogé sur la motivation des décisions du Conseil. Le seuil des 3/5e des voix « contre » n’ayant pas été atteint à une voix près, sa nomination ne rencontre plus d’obstacle.","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"video":{"thumb":"https://video.bsky.app/watch/did%3Aplc%3Aezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreidr5mqgvjelbnse4jt6t3aevywvg6hbfngs6lh3dhofnrfbtywyza/thumbnail.jpg","alt":""}},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/app.bsky.feed.post/3lik5y4a77c2u","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i","uri":"at://did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/app.bsky.feed.post/3lik5y4a77c2u","cid":"bafyreib3rakvovudyfcyjiz4pbvjsmsacixalcazvn7fwqfnvswjgjgb2q","auteur_did":"did:plc:ezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/sbg-senat.bsky.social/post/3lik5y4a77c2u","date":"2025-02-19T16:09:41.111Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-02-19T16:09:43.449Z","text":"La Commission des lois a auditionné Philippe Bas, le candidat proposé par Gérard Larcher pour intégrer le Conseil constitutionnel. J’ai tenu à l’interroger sur la compétence du Conseil en matière de contentieux électoral, ainsi que sur sa pratique du déport. Sa nomination a été largement approuvée.","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"video":{"thumb":"https://video.bsky.app/watch/did%3Aplc%3Aezd6jgfviixxtmgps5f37a6i/bafkreiaial7qu3sgorbs2raorb2val4m4yw64yvjoivlfp3satmxalnpna/thumbnail.jpg","alt":""}},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:ij2zfnls7gz6rwailozlrcwd/app.bsky.feed.post/3lihunxjmdc2h","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:ij2zfnls7gz6rwailozlrcwd","uri":"at://did:plc:ij2zfnls7gz6rwailozlrcwd/app.bsky.feed.post/3lihunxjmdc2h","cid":"bafyreifblzj25qn3qptn72iq5svaix6zx5gmtw3qriz3lvflusyojqvh6a","auteur_did":"did:plc:ij2zfnls7gz6rwailozlrcwd","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/vincentcaure.bsky.social/post/3lihunxjmdc2h","date":"2025-02-18T18:17:36.248Z","type":"reply","indexe":"2025-02-18T18:17:36.248Z","text":"Ce texte sera une avancée majeure en matière de lutte contre le trafic et la criminalité organisée. \n\nIl permettra notamment de mieux accompagner les maires qui font face à ce problème, de mieux protéger nos enfants et de donner tous les moyens à ceux qui luttent contre le narcotrafic.","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":{"name":"Vincent Caure","handle":"vincentcaure.bsky.social"},"embed":null,"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
