{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:ij2zfnls7gz6rwailozlrcwd/app.bsky.feed.post/3lhtrpged5k2k","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:ij2zfnls7gz6rwailozlrcwd","uri":"at://did:plc:ij2zfnls7gz6rwailozlrcwd/app.bsky.feed.post/3lhtrpged5k2k","cid":"bafyreigzdxvqjm2jquit4enqeolrovz7dyq6i6ur4iwrr6a2ppdr2fnjaa","auteur_did":"did:plc:ij2zfnls7gz6rwailozlrcwd","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/vincentcaure.bsky.social/post/3lhtrpged5k2k","date":"2025-02-10T18:31:30.595Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-02-10T18:31:30.863Z","text":"À la suite des menaces de #Trump sur le #Groenland, j'ai souhaité me rendre auprès des 🇫🇷 du 🇩🇰\n\n🎙 À Copenhague, j'en ai profité pour répondre aux questions de LePetitJournal.com sur mon mandat de député des Français d'Europe du Nord. \n\n👉🏻 lepetitjournal.com/copenhague/a...","facets":[{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag","tag":"Trump"}],"index":{"byteEnd":33,"byteStart":27}},{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag","tag":"Groenland"}],"index":{"byteEnd":51,"byteStart":41}},{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#link","uri":"https://LePetitJournal.com"}],"index":{"byteEnd":199,"byteStart":181}},{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#link","uri":"https://lepetitjournal.com/copenhague/actualites/rencontre-vincent-caure-depute-francais-de-letranger-404598"}],"index":{"byteEnd":304,"byteStart":270}}],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":null,"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lhsiyuvgtk2w","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","uri":"at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lhsiyuvgtk2w","cid":"bafyreigql3h2vxxohdpmbdq7sfa4re3r7zilke4qpqitwml4slykz2mgau","auteur_did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/kbencheikh.bsky.social/post/3lhsiyuvgtk2w","date":"2025-02-10T06:23:04.391Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-02-10T06:23:06.652Z","text":"🚀J'ai été nommé à la tête du groupe d'amitié France / Cap-Vert !  \nCette nomination m'honore. Je me réjouis de pouvoir contribuer au rapprochement de nos institutions respectives et au développement de la diplomatie parlementaire entre nos deux pays","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"images":[{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/bafkreifijbubcag7pvd6vj5crcbtcmbr4scygb5wialdvzqzejsmiz7uim","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/bafkreifijbubcag7pvd6vj5crcbtcmbr4scygb5wialdvzqzejsmiz7uim","alt":"","ar":{"height":1080,"width":1080}}]},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
